---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lang = 'en-us';
const title = 'Privacy Policy | Amalfi Coast Travel Guide';
const description = 'Privacy policy and personal data processing information for amalficoast-travel.com under GDPR.';
const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/en-us/' },
  { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: '/en-us/privacy-policy/' },
];
---
<BaseLayout {title} {description} {lang} {breadcrumbs}>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-12">Pursuant to EU Regulation 2016/679 (GDPR) — Last updated: May 2026</p>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">1. Data Controller</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Amalfi Coast Travel<br/>Email: <a href="mailto:amalficoastravel@gmail.com" class="text-med-blue hover:underline">amalficoastravel@gmail.com</a><br/>Country: Italy</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">2. Data Collected</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">This site does not collect personal data directly. There are no contact forms, user accounts, or registration systems. Only anonymous browsing data is processed through third-party tools, activated only with your consent:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate-600 space-y-1">
        <li>Pages visited and session duration</li>
        <li>Device type, browser, and operating system</li>
        <li>Approximate country of origin</li>
        <li>Navigation behaviour (clicks, scrolling)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">3. Purpose and Legal Basis</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Data is processed exclusively for statistical purposes and service improvement. The legal basis is the <strong>consent of the data subject</strong> (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). Analytics cookies are only activated after you give explicit consent via the cookie banner.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">4. Analytics Tools</h2>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2 mt-6">Google Analytics 4 (Google LLC, USA)</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-2">Web traffic analytics service. IP addresses are anonymised. Data transfer to the USA is based on Standard Contractual Clauses (Art. 46 GDPR).</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm"><a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-med-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="text-med-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Opt-out Google Analytics</a></p>

      <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2 mt-6">Microsoft Clarity (Microsoft Corporation, USA)</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-2">Behavioural analytics tool that generates anonymised heatmaps and session recordings. Data transfer to the USA is based on Standard Contractual Clauses.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm"><a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement" class="text-med-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Microsoft Privacy Statement</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">5. Retention Period</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-slate-600 space-y-1">
        <li>Google Analytics: 14 months</li>
        <li>Microsoft Clarity: 13 months</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">6. Third-Party Disclosure</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Data is transmitted exclusively to Google LLC and Microsoft Corporation as data processors. It is not sold or shared with third parties for commercial or advertising purposes.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">7. Your Rights</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Under Arts. 15–22 GDPR, you have the right to access your data, request rectification or erasure, restrict processing, object to processing, and withdraw consent at any time.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">To exercise your rights: <a href="mailto:amalficoastravel@gmail.com" class="text-med-blue hover:underline">amalficoastravel@gmail.com</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">8. Right to Lodge a Complaint</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">You have the right to lodge a complaint with the Italian Data Protection Authority (<a href="https://www.garanteprivacy.it" class="text-med-blue hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Garante per la Protezione dei Dati Personali</a>).</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">9. Cookies</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">For detailed information about the cookies used, see the <a href="/en-us/cookie-policy/" class="text-med-blue hover:underline">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
